Z||000000||TWEETIE BIRD||03-29-2001||11:28 PM||||I would have had more pictures but my batteries died <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><BR>I wish more people would have displayed their<BR>Forum names. Fiero Lisa was the only one 4-WHEEL and I knew. We wore our Forum names on our shirts but we saw no one with theirs on their cars. <BR>Had a great time! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> We didn't have our cars there this time <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1314994&a=12350605&f=0" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=1314994&a=12350605&f=0</A> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.ascenture.net/users/bhhum/fiero1.jpg"> ||||reg||10
