Z||000004||TWEETIE BIRD||03-30-2001||08:22 AM||||4-Wheel told me that he saw one flag. We then went to find it again but couldn't find it. <BR>We figured it either blew off or it was taken off for judging. It think I remember your car though. How did you do?||||reg||7
Z||000005||Phil||03-30-2001||08:45 AM||||I did quite well- took best of modified group(coupe and fastback)  I suppose now I'll have to sign those checks I gave the judges  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000006||TWEETIE BIRD||03-30-2001||08:55 AM||||Congratulations! Sorry we missed you. We only stayed at the show on saturday so we don't know how anyone did. Awesome show.||||reg||1
Z||000007||87GT||03-30-2001||01:46 PM||||Do you remember that black GT that was about diagonal from Lisa's at the show? You know the wild looking one?  Well, my fiero was to the left of it and I had a sign in my windshield with my name and my PFF name.  I dont think anybody looked at my car with that wild one next to me.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000008||TWEETIE BIRD||03-30-2001||02:22 PM||||We looked at everyone's Fieros. What color<BR>is it? Is that wild black one the one that had the blue trim? ||||reg||1
Z||000009||Alex4mula||03-30-2001||02:44 PM||||My car had a 3"x10" Pennock sign against the rear window 90% of the time. No one asked about it. I was next to Chris N* or three left from Phil's.||||reg||1
Z||000010||TWEETIE BIRD||03-30-2001||02:57 PM||||If your deck lid was up I could not see your sign. I looked in front windows.<P>No one asked us about our names either that we had on our shirts which were 4"x6".<P>4-WHEEL did see the one on the antenna. <P>That makes only 3 cars that were marked with the Forum emblem plus our shirts. Oh well.<P>Maybe we can all work something out for Carlisle.||||reg||1
Z||000011||87GT||03-30-2001||10:32 PM||||It was a black 86GT that had alligator lights on it, had some kind of ribbed cladding he put into the sides of it and had 2 dryer exhaust hoses sticking out at the top of the car.  My car was maroon with Mecham side scoops and I had my original window sticker and my PFF name in the windshield.  It was about 3 cars and 1 row ahead of Lisa'a car.||||reg||1
Z||000012||TWEETIE BIRD||03-30-2001||10:50 PM||||Yea, I remember that awful looking piece of <BR>"sewer drain pipes"....I remember yours too, I guess I was admiring yours so much I didn't notice the forum sticker. I really liked the side scoops <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Great car!!Are you going to <BR>Carlisle?||||reg||12
